<title>UK: GUS jumps after Hoare issues buy note.</title>
<headline>GUS jumps after Hoare issues buy note.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UK retailer Great Universal Stores jumped after ABN AMRO Hoare Govett initiated coverage with a buy note on the stock, traders said.</p>
<p>By 0804 GMT, the shares were up 15-1/2p to 640-1/2 p.</p>
<p>The brokerage firm assigned a valuation of 770p on the shares, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Debra Sherman, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
